{"title": "Unshackling Strike", "pageid": 15097, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unshackling_Strike", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Melee weapon attacks", "Actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Unshackling_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Unshackling_Strike.webp/300px-Unshackling_Strike.webp, /w/images/2/26/Unshackling_Strike.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Unshackling_Strike.webp/300px-Unshackling_Strike.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Unshackling_Strike.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b> Unshackling Strike </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Weapon_action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapon action\">weapon action</a> granted by <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\">Orphic Hammer</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nSmite the magical bonds keeping a creature <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(status_group)\" title=\"Restrained (status group)\">Restrained</a></span>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Paralyzed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Paralyzed_(status_group)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Paralyzed (status group)\">Paralyzed</a></span>, and <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Stunned\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stunned_(status_group)\" title=\"Stunned (status group)\">Stunned</a></span>, freeing it.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Melee Weapon Attack Roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Melee Weapon <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Roll\">Attack Roll</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Normal weapon range\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Normal weapon range</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_MAG_OrphicHammer_ChainBreaker</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_OrphicHammer_ChainBreaker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_MAG_OrphicHammer_ChainBreaker\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Orphic_Hammer_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\">Orphic Hammer</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is the only action in the game able to destroy the Infernal Crystals keeping <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/38px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/50px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a> imprisoned.</li>\n<li>Unshackling Strike does not free <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/38px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/50px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Orpheus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png/25px-Portrait_Orpheus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e0/Portrait_Orpheus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Orpheus\" title=\"Orpheus\">Orpheus</a>, instead, the Infernal Crystals (<i>not</i> the Minor Orb of Domination) need to be struck with a <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Attack\" title=\"Main Hand Attack\">regular attack</a> while wielding the <a href=\"/wiki/Orphic_Hammer\" title=\"Orphic Hammer\">Orphic Hammer</a>.</li>\n<li>Unshackling Strike uses a melee weapon attack roll, meaning that using it against a friendly character with high <a href=\"/wiki/Armor_Class\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a> is likely to result in a miss.</li>\n<li>The icon for this action is reminiscent of the Dispel Magic icons in Baldur's Gate 1 and 2, and it is in fact labelled <code>Spell_Abjuration_DispelMagic</code> within the game files. However, according to Swen Vincke, Dispel Magic was cut content for Baldur's Gate 3. He relates how Baldur's Gate 3 devs tried to make D&amp;D's Dispel Magic work for a long time, but ultimately abandoned it: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/baldurs-gate-3-devs-tried-to-make-dandds-dispel-magic-work-for-a-long-time-but-they-had-to-can-it-it-wouldve-doubled-the-size-of-the-game/\"><i>\"it would've doubled the size of the game.\"</i></a></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034651\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.079 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.083 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3554/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41641/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16932/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.026/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1550823/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   70.529      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   70.529      1 -total\n 87.30%   61.571     45 Template:Trim\n 16.97%   11.972      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 16.90%   11.922      2 Template:Item_icon\n 13.18%    9.294      7 Template:Icon_text\n  9.61%    6.776      2 Template:Hidden_code\n  8.25%    5.817      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.88%    5.558      3 Template:Condition_type\n  7.88%    5.555      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:15097-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715034651 and revision id 374436. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}